WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:43.440
I came to ask you something,
Ms. Qiong Zhi.

01:43.520 --> 01:46.360
What's the matter?
Do I know your sweetheart?

01:47.960 --> 01:48.800
Maybe

01:50.320 --> 01:52.240
I know your sweetheart.

01:52.320 --> 01:54.400
I don't even know I have a sweetheart.

01:54.480 --> 01:55.880
The son of Huaixiang's magistrate,

01:57.200 --> 01:58.040
Xue Zhao.

02:02.000 --> 02:05.640
I didn't expect you
to have such good manners, Duke Su.

02:16.440 --> 02:18.680
- What are you doing?
- You've seen my body.

02:19.240 --> 02:20.560
Can't I have a look at yours?

02:26.880 --> 02:28.600
Rough and wild. I like it.

02:32.040 --> 02:33.200
What did you just make me eat?

02:33.280 --> 02:34.440
Nanjiang's poisonous insect.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.400
Without the antidote,

02:35.480 --> 02:38.040
your seven orifices will bleed
until you die within a month.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.120
Who are you?

02:44.000 --> 02:45.240
I am Xue Zhao's friend,

02:46.680 --> 02:47.640
Jiang Li.

02:47.720 --> 02:49.920
Hold her down and take her
to the brothel to pay the debt.

02:50.000 --> 02:51.440
- Help!
- Behave yourself!

02:51.520 --> 02:52.680
- Save me!
- Let's go!

02:52.760 --> 02:53.640
Help!

02:54.280 --> 02:55.600
Save me!

02:55.680 --> 02:56.800
- Go.
- Let go of me!

03:09.040 --> 03:10.840
You're abducting a woman
in broad daylight.

03:10.920 --> 03:11.760
Is there no law?

03:13.080 --> 03:13.920
Who are you?

03:14.000 --> 03:16.440
Mind your own business. She owes me money.

03:16.520 --> 03:17.640
I already told you.

03:17.720 --> 03:20.240
I'd pay you five taels every month.
I won't renege on the debt.

03:20.320 --> 03:21.360
Five taels?

03:21.440 --> 03:23.400
Your father owes me 50 taels.

03:23.480 --> 03:25.880
What if you disappear like him one day?

03:25.960 --> 03:27.680
Who will pay me the money then?

03:27.760 --> 03:29.720
Forcing a decent lady into prostitution
is against the law.

03:29.800 --> 03:31.440
Moreover, this lady said she'll pay you.

03:31.520 --> 03:33.160
Why are you still forcing her?

03:33.240 --> 03:34.320
Such a busybody.

03:34.400 --> 03:35.320
Beat him up!

03:46.520 --> 03:47.920
Do you know your mistake?

03:48.000 --> 03:49.280
Yes.

03:49.960 --> 03:52.480
She will pay you every month from now on.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.840
If you harass her again,

03:54.920 --> 03:56.280
don't blame me for being merciless.

03:56.360 --> 03:58.640
Yes, I'll listen to you.

04:03.080 --> 04:04.280
Pay on time.

04:04.360 --> 04:05.360
Let's go.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.320
Are you all right?

04:12.560 --> 04:14.920
I won't ever forget your great kindness.

04:15.000 --> 04:16.920
Those people won't give up easily.

04:18.240 --> 04:21.440
I will come to Luyang every five days.

04:21.519 --> 04:22.960
If they dare cause trouble again,

04:23.520 --> 04:24.720
I will drive them away for you.

04:25.720 --> 04:28.440
I thought he just casually said it.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.000
Never did I expect

04:30.960 --> 04:33.200
that he'd really come to see me
every five days.

04:35.440 --> 04:38.760
Back then, before he came to Luyang,

04:39.440 --> 04:41.320
he would always try on several outfits

04:41.400 --> 04:43.360
until he was satisfied before leaving.

04:45.800 --> 04:47.400
You seem to know him well.

04:48.680 --> 04:51.280
Xue Zhao's sister was my friend.

04:52.720 --> 04:54.480
It was Xue Zhao's sister who told me.

04:55.640 --> 04:57.280
What are you carving? It looks so ugly.

04:58.840 --> 05:00.560
Never mind. I'll carve another one.

05:03.240 --> 05:04.120
You have so many.

05:06.880 --> 05:09.360
Who are you carving this for?
You're putting in so much effort.

05:11.000 --> 05:12.080
It's for my sweetheart.

05:14.360 --> 05:16.840
People usually carve the name
of the recipient.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.880
Why are you carving your own?

05:18.960 --> 05:21.320
I'm carving my own name on this

05:21.800 --> 05:23.800
so that when she sees it,
she'll think of me.

05:24.760 --> 05:26.400
When we first met,

05:26.880 --> 05:28.200
I was a decent lady.

05:31.880 --> 05:32.880
But now…

05:37.680 --> 05:39.520
He must be very disappointed in me.

05:43.480 --> 05:45.240
That's why he never sought me out again.

05:45.320 --> 05:46.480
Life is unpredictable.

05:47.600 --> 05:49.280
It's not that he doesn't want to see you.

05:50.040 --> 05:50.880
It's that

05:52.200 --> 05:53.360
he died.

05:56.520 --> 05:58.640
Xue Zhao was killed by bandits

06:00.400 --> 06:01.920
on his way to the capital.

06:03.040 --> 06:04.800
His body was thrown into the river.

06:04.880 --> 06:05.720
Not only that,

06:06.280 --> 06:08.000
the three members of the Xue family,

06:08.080 --> 06:08.920
including his father

06:09.480 --> 06:10.320
and his sister,

06:11.640 --> 06:12.520
all died.

06:17.680 --> 06:18.880
Xue Zhao.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.560
Within just half a year,

06:25.920 --> 06:28.600
the three members of the Xue family
were met with misfortune.

06:28.680 --> 06:31.120
There must be something fishy about this.

06:31.200 --> 06:35.120
I came here this time
to find out the truth.

06:35.680 --> 06:38.640
Can you tell me if you know anything?

06:47.240 --> 06:48.080
ZHAO

06:48.160 --> 06:49.240
Xue Zhao

06:49.800 --> 06:52.200
gave this to me
the last time he came to see me.

06:52.800 --> 06:54.600
There were ten taels of silver in it.

06:56.400 --> 07:00.000
He said if the creditors came again,

07:00.760 --> 07:02.760
I could use the silver to pay them first.

07:03.320 --> 07:04.640
But when those people

07:06.440 --> 07:08.560
saw that Xue Zhao never showed up again,

07:09.120 --> 07:10.640
they became even more savage.

07:11.200 --> 07:12.880
This much money is nothing to them.

07:19.280 --> 07:20.400
Have you seen this before?

07:21.280 --> 07:22.280
See if you recognize it.

07:23.840 --> 07:28.200
MINING AREA, SLOPE, STEEP PATH

07:31.640 --> 07:33.560
Xue Zhao hid this among the silver.

07:37.240 --> 07:39.000
I don't understand the drawing on it,

07:40.360 --> 07:42.440
but I recognize the handwriting.

07:42.520 --> 07:43.440
It's Xue Zhao's.

07:44.240 --> 07:45.720
I've kept it to myself.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.320
I've never shown it to anyone before.

07:47.800 --> 07:49.120
Since he left this to you,

07:52.880 --> 07:53.880
keep it safe.

07:58.080 --> 07:58.920
Miss,

08:00.600 --> 08:02.480
is there anything I can do to help?

08:04.160 --> 08:05.200
Xihua Brothel

08:05.960 --> 08:08.160
is Luyang's most flourishing brothel.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.960
You can check news
about Luyang more easily than I can.

08:11.040 --> 08:13.080
I'd like to ask you to help me check

08:13.720 --> 08:15.520
how the magistrate of Huaixiang,
Xue Huaiyuan,

08:16.240 --> 08:18.120
died six months ago,

08:18.200 --> 08:21.000
who handled his funeral,
and where he was buried.

08:21.080 --> 08:23.160
This would fulfill my obligations
to the Xue family.

08:26.720 --> 08:29.560
ZHAO

08:29.640 --> 08:32.120
I owe that to Xue Zhao.

08:33.480 --> 08:35.120
I will definitely help you.

08:35.200 --> 08:37.480
Then I will await your good news.

08:45.040 --> 08:45.960
Miss.

08:47.880 --> 08:48.720
Where

08:51.360 --> 08:52.440
is Xue Zhao buried?

08:53.040 --> 08:54.560
His cenotaph

08:55.160 --> 08:56.000
is in the capital.

08:56.480 --> 08:59.240
He and his sister will go back
to their hometown.

09:00.160 --> 09:02.560
I will make sure they reunite again.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.800
I'll give you two options.

09:34.880 --> 09:37.000
One, go and tell Chu Lan.

09:37.080 --> 09:39.120
Two, join forces with me.

09:39.200 --> 09:40.360
Join forces?

09:40.440 --> 09:42.960
Bring down Chu Lan
and I'll give you the antidote.

09:47.480 --> 09:49.040
You're more interesting than Chu Lan.

09:49.560 --> 09:50.800
If I help you bring him down,

09:53.880 --> 09:55.000
will you visit often?

09:56.120 --> 09:57.360
It depends on your performance.

10:05.280 --> 10:06.120
Duke Su?

10:17.080 --> 10:18.080
Why are you here?

10:18.640 --> 10:19.560
Investigating a case.

10:20.160 --> 10:21.040
What a coincidence.

10:22.040 --> 10:25.080
I came to Luyang
and you also came here to investigate.

10:25.160 --> 10:29.160
Why? Are you going to say
I'm stalking you again?

10:38.880 --> 10:41.640
You were in such a hurry
that you dropped something.

10:51.760 --> 10:54.440
You might as well give me
such an exquisite jade pendant.

10:56.080 --> 10:57.920
I guess I've misunderstood.

11:01.360 --> 11:03.080
You are indeed here for a case.

11:04.840 --> 11:05.760
I won't disturb you.

11:06.600 --> 11:07.760
I'll get going now.

11:08.880 --> 11:10.520
Li.

11:14.840 --> 11:16.280
It seems you don't want to cooperate.

11:21.240 --> 11:23.200
It's normal
for a young lady to be jealous.

11:23.280 --> 11:24.520
Just explain it to her clearly.

11:25.000 --> 11:25.960
Jealous?

11:32.800 --> 11:34.120
I'll let you off this time.

11:34.920 --> 11:36.000
If this happens again,

11:37.000 --> 11:39.120
I won't mind finding someone else
to cooperate with.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.720
Miss, I was wandering around
by the front door

11:48.800 --> 11:50.040
and I saw Duke Su.

11:51.600 --> 11:53.440
What he does is none of my business.

12:07.600 --> 12:09.560
Ms. Jia'er, these are
the accounts for this month.

12:09.640 --> 12:11.240
I don't need to account them.
They're all in my head.

12:11.320 --> 12:13.880
Lizheng Hall sold 921 bolts of fabrics
this month,

12:13.960 --> 12:15.880
totaling 1,353 taels of silver.

12:15.960 --> 12:17.960
Revenue is up 10% compared to last month.

12:18.040 --> 12:20.520
It's good if you look
at the accounts alone.

12:20.600 --> 12:21.760
But as the cool autumn begins,

12:21.840 --> 12:23.320
people are buying new clothes.

12:23.400 --> 12:25.480
The attire for autumn
is more expensive than summer.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.800
So looking at the overall accounts,

12:27.880 --> 12:29.880
we are actually running a deficit
this month.

12:29.960 --> 12:32.520
Ms. Jia'er, stop calculating.
Madam Zhuo is waiting for you inside.

12:32.600 --> 12:33.440
Let's go.

12:40.120 --> 12:41.720
Mother, I'm back!

12:52.360 --> 12:55.000
Madam Zhuo!

12:55.560 --> 12:57.200
- Just let me die!
- Mother!

12:57.960 --> 12:59.120
What's wrong again?

12:59.200 --> 13:00.040
Ms. Li!

13:00.880 --> 13:02.000
Ms. Jia'er,

13:02.080 --> 13:03.920
Mr. Ye came back

13:04.000 --> 13:07.320
with a little vixen this time.

13:09.480 --> 13:10.720
- I don't want to live anymore!
- Madam Zhuo!

13:10.800 --> 13:12.520
Dear, I'm back!

13:18.440 --> 13:19.880
Ms. Li, take good care of my mother.

13:19.960 --> 13:21.440
I'll go and ask my father about this.

13:21.520 --> 13:24.080
- Little vixen!
- Mr. Li!

13:28.840 --> 13:30.000
Madam Zhuo.

13:36.400 --> 13:38.320
Madam Zhuo!

13:38.400 --> 13:40.520
Father, what's wrong with you?

13:40.600 --> 13:41.680
What do you mean?

13:41.760 --> 13:43.360
Little vixen.

13:43.440 --> 13:45.360
What little vixen?

13:45.440 --> 13:46.920
You brought her back and you're asking me?

13:47.000 --> 13:48.880
Me? I brought her back?

13:48.960 --> 13:50.480
Little vixen?

13:54.440 --> 13:56.320
- You must be referring to Jiang Li.
- Look.

13:56.400 --> 13:59.040
You're calling her so affectionately
and you say she's not a little vixen.

13:59.880 --> 14:02.560
The one you're calling "little vixen"

14:02.640 --> 14:03.880
is our relative.

14:03.960 --> 14:07.240
She's Jiang Li from the capital.

14:09.640 --> 14:11.280
The one who looked down
on us for being merchants?

14:12.560 --> 14:15.000
Father, our family is already a mess.

14:15.080 --> 14:17.280
Why did you bring
such a big troublemaker back?

14:17.360 --> 14:18.720
Watch your words.

14:18.800 --> 14:21.000
She's now the Chancellor's daughter

14:21.080 --> 14:22.200
and she's also your cousin.

14:24.360 --> 14:27.960
That little vixen has come
to our Ye family.

14:28.040 --> 14:28.960
Tell me, how…

14:29.040 --> 14:31.920
Father, you'd better take care
of the current trouble first.

14:32.000 --> 14:33.360
Let me die!

14:33.840 --> 14:36.040
The moment that little vixen

14:36.120 --> 14:37.840
steps into the Ye Residence,

14:37.920 --> 14:40.920
there won't be any peace in the Ye family.

14:41.520 --> 14:44.680
Madam Zhuo, you cannot die.

14:44.760 --> 14:46.480
- Let me die!
- Madam Zhuo.

14:46.560 --> 14:49.680
If the little vixen is in this family,
there's no room for me.

14:49.760 --> 14:52.800
If I'm here, there won't be room
for that little vixen.

14:52.880 --> 14:55.720
I'll die with you.

14:57.920 --> 14:58.960
Why are you messing around?

15:01.520 --> 15:05.000
- I don't want to live anymore!
- Dear.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.320
Even if you want to die,

15:08.400 --> 15:11.000
we still need to make things clear.

15:11.080 --> 15:14.640
I don't want to live anymore!

15:14.720 --> 15:15.680
Shut up!

15:17.040 --> 15:18.760
The person you are talking about

15:18.840 --> 15:21.200
is not a little vixen.

15:21.280 --> 15:24.080
She's our niece, Jiang Li.

15:28.360 --> 15:29.240
Help!

15:29.920 --> 15:31.200
- Dear!
- Mother!

15:31.280 --> 15:32.160
Dear!

15:35.680 --> 15:38.320
Since Shijie became the Vice Director
of the Ministry of Revenue,

15:38.400 --> 15:39.760
she has come to butter us up.

15:40.280 --> 15:41.320
Father, look at you too.

15:42.000 --> 15:43.880
Why did you have to bring her back?

15:43.960 --> 15:45.520
You're always blabbering.

15:47.400 --> 15:49.680
Even though Shijie
has become the Vice Director,

15:49.760 --> 15:50.800
the Jiang family

15:50.880 --> 15:52.360
doesn't need to curry favor with us.

15:52.440 --> 15:53.360
Furthermore,

15:53.440 --> 15:55.640
your cousin said
she wanted to come with me.

15:55.720 --> 15:57.000
Could I stop her from coming?

15:57.080 --> 15:59.640
I don't acknowledge her as my cousin.

15:59.720 --> 16:00.920
Let's leave it at that for now.

16:01.000 --> 16:01.960
Let's see how it goes.

16:02.040 --> 16:04.880
There's a lot going on at home lately
and the shop is chaotic too.

16:04.960 --> 16:07.120
Old Madam is getting headaches
due to business matters.

16:07.680 --> 16:09.680
If she finds out that Jiang Li is here,

16:09.760 --> 16:11.600
there may be big trouble.

16:14.880 --> 16:16.560
Let's handle business matters first.

16:17.120 --> 16:19.880
We must slowly break it to Old Madam

16:20.400 --> 16:22.080
so as not to shock her.

16:22.160 --> 16:24.720
But we can't just leave her
like this either.

16:25.320 --> 16:27.120
One person in our family should step up

16:27.200 --> 16:29.560
to properly entertain Jiang Li tomorrow.

16:29.640 --> 16:31.120
Otherwise, it'll seem like our family

16:31.200 --> 16:32.360
has no manners,

16:32.440 --> 16:34.040
making us a joke to the Jiang family.

16:35.400 --> 16:36.240
Who will do it?

16:39.960 --> 16:41.000
Why are you looking at me?

16:41.480 --> 16:42.880
I just made a fuss about her.

16:42.960 --> 16:44.720
Anyone can do it but me.

16:47.840 --> 16:49.040
Don't look at me.

16:49.120 --> 16:50.640
I have to go to the shop tomorrow.

16:50.720 --> 16:52.080
I don't have time.

16:54.520 --> 16:56.360
Why are you all looking at me?

16:56.440 --> 16:58.640
I've been the one
entertaining Jiang Li all along.

16:58.720 --> 16:59.800
You never showed up,

16:59.880 --> 17:01.200
making it look like the Ye family

17:01.280 --> 17:02.360
didn't welcome her.

17:07.640 --> 17:10.680
Why don't we follow
our family's tradition?

17:10.760 --> 17:11.640
Let's draw lots.

17:18.079 --> 17:22.079
There are three paper balls
and only one has writing on it.

17:22.800 --> 17:25.240
- Whoever draws it will go.
- I'm not drawing.

17:27.160 --> 17:28.280
You go first, dear.

17:28.760 --> 17:30.280
Jia'er is the youngest. She goes first.

17:30.760 --> 17:32.680
I already said I'm not drawing.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.160
Draw one.

17:34.240 --> 17:35.320
Come on.

17:53.720 --> 17:55.200
- Thank you, Jia'er.
- Thank you, Jia'er.

17:55.280 --> 17:57.240
- Take a day off tomorrow.
- Take a day off tomorrow.

18:04.880 --> 18:07.680
- Tell the coachman to ready the carriage.
- Yes.

18:07.760 --> 18:09.840
Remember, let the kitchen
prepare snacks for the ride.

18:09.920 --> 18:12.000
- Yes.
- And the warm water to wash the face?

18:12.080 --> 18:13.280
- It's ready.
- The clothes and jewelry?

18:13.360 --> 18:14.640
- They're ready.
- The blush.

18:14.720 --> 18:15.560
Tong'er?

18:17.000 --> 18:17.840
Tong'er.

18:23.760 --> 18:25.240
Miss, you're awake.

18:25.320 --> 18:27.920
It's so early in the morning.
Who's talking outside?

18:28.000 --> 18:30.040
Miss, it's Ms. Jia'er.

18:30.120 --> 18:31.680
Ms. Jia'er got up early

18:31.760 --> 18:33.160
and invited us to go out.

18:33.240 --> 18:34.280
Go out?

18:35.080 --> 18:36.240
So early?

18:36.320 --> 18:38.400
Miss, so many things happened yesterday.

18:38.480 --> 18:39.520
You didn't get enough rest.

18:39.600 --> 18:42.280
Should I go and refuse her now
so you can sleep a bit more?

18:42.840 --> 18:44.480
She's kind enough to arrange it.

18:44.560 --> 18:45.400
We have to go.

18:47.160 --> 18:48.160
It's for fun anyway.

18:49.040 --> 18:50.400
Let's go. Help me freshen up.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.560
Is she not up yet? Fine.

18:53.120 --> 18:54.720
We've already woken her up in advance.

19:00.880 --> 19:02.040
You woke up late.

19:02.960 --> 19:04.600
More people
can help you freshen up faster.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.480
Jia'er.

19:20.840 --> 19:23.480
Today, we'll go
to Baizhang Mountain first,

19:23.560 --> 19:24.680
then to Sijing Lake.

19:24.760 --> 19:26.680
We'll have
Juewei Restaurant's specialties at noon.

19:26.760 --> 19:28.320
In the afternoon,
we'll watch a magic show at Bai House

19:28.400 --> 19:29.400
and see monkeys at Miao Garden.

19:29.480 --> 19:31.400
At night, we'll go boating
on Liangshui River.

19:31.480 --> 19:34.560
Jia'er, there's no need
to visit so many places,

19:35.080 --> 19:36.320
so we can have more time.

19:36.920 --> 19:39.120
These are all must-go places in Luyang.

19:39.200 --> 19:40.680
As long as we stick to the schedule,

19:40.760 --> 19:41.760
we'll be able to do it.

19:41.840 --> 19:44.320
I can't spare two days to accompany you.

19:49.880 --> 19:52.920
Jia'er, I know you're entrusted
by your family.

19:53.000 --> 19:55.080
You're worried I'd feel aggrieved,
so you want to take me everywhere.

19:55.640 --> 19:58.200
Actually, I'm tired from the journey

19:58.280 --> 19:59.440
and don't feel like going out.

19:59.520 --> 20:00.760
What do you mean?

20:00.840 --> 20:02.360
Are you not happy with my plans?

20:02.440 --> 20:04.240
If you don't like it, we can make changes.

20:04.320 --> 20:05.400
How about this?

20:06.120 --> 20:07.880
I'll tell Uncle Mingxuan and Aunt Zhuo

20:08.400 --> 20:11.560
that you've shown me

20:11.640 --> 20:13.440
all the scenic spots
and delicacies of Luyang.

20:13.520 --> 20:15.400
That way, you won't be too tired

20:15.480 --> 20:16.560
and we won't waste time.

20:17.040 --> 20:17.880
What do you think?

20:17.960 --> 20:20.560
Since you're so open with me,

20:21.080 --> 20:23.520
I'll be straightforward too.

20:24.000 --> 20:26.040
You're the one
who said you don't want to go.

20:26.120 --> 20:27.560
I'm not being a bad host.

20:27.640 --> 20:30.840
You've put in a lot of effort.
You are definitely a great host.

20:30.920 --> 20:32.880
You should have said so earlier.

20:32.960 --> 20:35.640
There are a lot of issues at the shop
that need my attention.

20:35.720 --> 20:37.000
The carriage is ready for you.

20:37.080 --> 20:39.680
You can go wherever you want
when dawn breaks and return at night.

20:40.400 --> 20:41.240
Jia'er.

20:44.480 --> 20:46.000
I want to visit the family's shop.

20:47.120 --> 20:49.240
I didn't bring many clothes with me.

20:49.920 --> 20:51.720
I'd like to make some new ones.

20:51.800 --> 20:53.560
Don't you know it's still dark?

20:54.560 --> 20:57.040
Don't you know the shop isn't open yet?

21:02.840 --> 21:04.000
We'll leave in two hours.

21:05.320 --> 21:06.680
Let's go.

21:33.920 --> 21:36.840
LIZHENG HALL

21:36.920 --> 21:39.920
Mingyu, I can't give you this money.

21:41.360 --> 21:42.200
Mingyu,

21:42.280 --> 21:44.480
all the money in the shop
has to be accounted for.

21:44.560 --> 21:45.760
If you want to withdraw it,

21:45.840 --> 21:47.920
you must have a receipt stamped by Mr. Ye.

21:48.000 --> 21:48.840
That's the rule.

21:48.920 --> 21:50.560
Last time, there was no such rule.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.720
This time, there is?

21:51.800 --> 21:52.680
YE MINGYU

21:52.760 --> 21:54.320
Are you making rules for me?

21:54.400 --> 21:55.400
Uncle Mingyu?

21:57.160 --> 21:58.000
Uncle Mingyu?

22:00.560 --> 22:02.240
Mingyu, you can't do this.

22:03.120 --> 22:04.640
Mingyu, you can't do this.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.640
Jia'er,

22:07.920 --> 22:09.000
what's the matter with him?

22:10.840 --> 22:12.360
I bet he got into another business deal

22:12.440 --> 22:14.520
and lost all his money,
so he's here to borrow some.

22:15.560 --> 22:16.680
Wait here for a moment.

22:16.760 --> 22:18.320
Come over after I've sorted this out.

22:23.160 --> 22:24.880
- I can't…
- Uncle Mingyu.

22:24.960 --> 22:27.800
What are you doing here instead
of going home when you're back in Luyang?

22:27.880 --> 22:29.400
Ms. Jia'er, you're finally here.

22:32.840 --> 22:33.800
Jia'er.

22:33.880 --> 22:35.240
You came just in time.

22:35.320 --> 22:36.800
Quick, give me some money.

22:36.880 --> 22:39.280
I have a business deal
and I must make the final payment.

22:39.360 --> 22:40.880
How much do you need, Uncle Mingyu?

22:42.360 --> 22:43.920
Just a few thousand taels should do.

22:44.640 --> 22:45.920
What kind of business deal is it?

22:46.000 --> 22:48.760
You wouldn't get it even if I told you.
Just give me the money.

22:48.840 --> 22:51.080
After I make money,
I'll return more to you.

22:51.160 --> 22:53.680
Uncle Mingyu, I don't want
to be saddled with bad debts.

22:54.360 --> 22:55.560
You've become capable.

22:56.040 --> 22:57.280
You little brat.

22:57.360 --> 22:59.600
After making money in business,
you don't acknowledge me.

22:59.680 --> 23:01.960
- Cut the crap and just give me the money.
- No.

23:02.960 --> 23:05.400
Uncle Mingyu, it's not hard
to borrow again after paying.

23:05.480 --> 23:07.440
I'll lend you money
after you've cleared past debts.

23:07.520 --> 23:09.200
Otherwise, you'd better go to my father.

23:09.280 --> 23:10.480
You've really become capable,

23:11.240 --> 23:12.560
using your father to pressure me.

23:12.640 --> 23:14.840
Don't blame me
for not playing nice today then.

23:18.880 --> 23:20.840
If you don't give me money today,
I'm not leaving.

23:20.920 --> 23:22.360
That's right. We're not leaving.

23:30.560 --> 23:31.440
Mingyu.

23:31.520 --> 23:33.240
What? Are you going to hit me?

23:33.320 --> 23:34.240
Try it.

23:34.320 --> 23:35.800
- I wouldn't dare.
- Get lost.

23:36.560 --> 23:37.840
I am your third uncle.

23:37.920 --> 23:40.440
Do you want me to go to your grandmother
and make you suffer?

23:49.640 --> 23:50.480
Uncle Mingyu.

23:51.960 --> 23:54.600
Jia'er manages
Lizheng Hall's accounts now.

23:54.680 --> 23:56.080
Don't make things difficult for her.

23:56.160 --> 23:57.000
Uncle Mingyu?

23:57.520 --> 23:58.840
Who are you?

23:59.320 --> 24:00.160
Go away.

24:00.240 --> 24:02.480
Uncle Mingyu, I'm Jiang Li.

24:03.600 --> 24:05.800
My mother is Ye Zhenzhen.

24:15.080 --> 24:17.280
BINGDE HALL

24:28.440 --> 24:29.880
You have never left home before.

24:30.360 --> 24:32.120
You must learn
to protect yourself out there.

24:33.840 --> 24:35.680
You are always my hero.

24:35.760 --> 24:36.760
You will protect me.

24:37.600 --> 24:40.200
Zhenzhen, you must be happy.

24:40.280 --> 24:41.680
I am very happy.

25:10.440 --> 25:13.040
Mother, I beg you!

25:13.880 --> 25:15.480
Please let me go to the Jiang family

25:15.560 --> 25:17.440
to bring Zhenzhen and Jiang Li back.

25:17.520 --> 25:19.760
Zhenzhen was most afraid of being alone
when she was alive.

25:20.240 --> 25:22.680
I can't let her die all alone.

25:22.760 --> 25:23.600
Mother!

25:23.680 --> 25:25.280
She married into the Jiang family.

25:25.360 --> 25:27.160
She lived as a member of the Jiang family

25:27.240 --> 25:29.760
and she's still
their family member after death.

25:29.840 --> 25:30.680
Mother!

25:38.240 --> 25:43.520
BINGDE HALL

25:56.160 --> 25:57.120
What…

25:59.960 --> 26:00.800
Jiang Li?

26:01.600 --> 26:02.440
Yes.

26:02.520 --> 26:03.960
When did you come to Luyang?

26:04.040 --> 26:06.360
I came two days ago with Uncle Mingxuan.

26:07.080 --> 26:09.280
I'm free today,
so I came to check out the shop.

26:09.360 --> 26:12.800
Have you been well these years?

26:12.880 --> 26:14.040
It's a long story.

26:15.200 --> 26:17.240
Uncle Mingyu, why don't we go home
and talk in detail?

26:18.360 --> 26:19.480
Forget it.

26:21.000 --> 26:22.480
- Forget it?
- Forget it!

26:24.080 --> 26:26.760
Today, on account of your mother,

26:27.840 --> 26:30.040
I don't want the money anymore.

26:32.160 --> 26:33.240
Shun,

26:33.720 --> 26:34.840
let's go.

26:34.920 --> 26:36.880
- Are we leaving just like that?
- Come on.

26:38.640 --> 26:41.040
Jiang Li, don't you want
to have some clothes made?

26:41.120 --> 26:43.320
Come, take a look
and see if there's anything you like.

26:47.400 --> 26:49.240
Ms. Jiang, these are the new fabrics

26:49.320 --> 26:50.280
from our shop.

26:50.360 --> 26:51.400
The quality is excellent.

26:51.480 --> 26:53.320
The colors are the most fashionable too.

26:54.160 --> 26:55.000
Mr. Qian.

26:55.640 --> 26:57.920
Mr. Qian. I want to return the goods.

26:58.600 --> 26:59.440
Mr. Zhao.

26:59.520 --> 27:01.240
What did you just say? Return the goods?

27:01.720 --> 27:03.680
This matter cannot be delayed any longer.

27:03.760 --> 27:05.160
Since your father is not here,

27:05.240 --> 27:06.440
I'll talk to you first.

27:07.840 --> 27:10.480
Jiang Li, I have something
to discuss with Mr. Zhao.

27:10.560 --> 27:13.160
Tell the manager to pack
any fabric you like and charge it to me.

27:13.240 --> 27:14.440
Jia'er, you can work first.

27:15.360 --> 27:16.640
- This way, please.
- All right.

27:20.280 --> 27:21.960
YE RESIDENCE

27:22.040 --> 27:24.040
Miss, is something bothering you?

27:25.160 --> 27:27.160
I keep feeling
that the Ye family is in trouble.

27:28.360 --> 27:29.960
And this trouble is not small.

27:30.040 --> 27:31.600
Ye Mingyu, that scoundrel!

27:32.160 --> 27:34.240
What has he become
after a few years outside?

27:34.320 --> 27:35.440
A bandit!

27:35.520 --> 27:37.360
Tell me. Which shops did he go to?

27:37.440 --> 27:38.680
I don't know.

27:38.760 --> 27:39.600
You…

27:39.680 --> 27:40.840
That guy…

27:42.720 --> 27:44.520
- Jiang Li, you're back.
- Uncle Mingxuan.

27:48.000 --> 27:49.880
Jiang Li, why did you come back alone?

27:49.960 --> 27:51.200
Didn't Jia'er accompany you?

27:51.760 --> 27:53.240
Jia'er arranged everything very well.

27:54.080 --> 27:55.600
I had a lot of fun today.

27:55.680 --> 27:57.880
She went to handle some matters
at the shop.

27:57.960 --> 27:59.320
That's why I came back alone.

28:00.600 --> 28:01.520
That's good.

28:02.720 --> 28:03.560
Uncle Mingxuan.

28:04.640 --> 28:06.120
Is there a problem

28:06.840 --> 28:08.160
with the family's business?

28:10.040 --> 28:10.880
Well…

28:11.360 --> 28:12.760
- Mingxuan.
- Dear.

28:13.360 --> 28:15.760
- Governor Tong sent people here.
- Governor Tong?

28:16.240 --> 28:17.560
Why did he send people here?

28:17.640 --> 28:18.800
I have no idea.

28:32.800 --> 28:34.200
Commandant Zhu,

28:34.280 --> 28:36.400
what brings you here this time?

28:36.480 --> 28:38.840
Mr. Ye, Governor Tong
is inviting you over.

28:38.920 --> 28:40.640
Where to?

28:41.160 --> 28:43.560
What crime has he committed?
Why is he the only one invited?

28:43.640 --> 28:44.600
What is this about?

28:44.680 --> 28:46.160
Mrs. Ye, you have quite a temper.

28:46.840 --> 28:48.320
I'm just doing my job.

28:48.400 --> 28:50.600
Please let Mr. Ye discuss these matters

28:51.240 --> 28:52.560
with Governor Tong.

28:52.640 --> 28:53.480
You…

28:55.080 --> 28:56.640
Our business is clean.

28:56.720 --> 28:57.880
A clean hand needs no washing.

28:57.960 --> 28:58.920
I'll go with them.

29:01.720 --> 29:04.400
Commandant Zhu, can you wait a moment?

29:04.480 --> 29:05.880
I'd like to talk to my family a bit.

29:13.600 --> 29:15.480
Jiang Li, I originally planned to take you

29:15.560 --> 29:17.160
to see your grandmother in a few days.

29:17.240 --> 29:19.360
I didn't expect these issues to arise.

29:20.360 --> 29:21.720
You must wait a little longer.

29:21.800 --> 29:23.800
Uncle Mingxuan,
do what you need to do first.

29:27.760 --> 29:29.880
Dear, while I'm away,

29:29.960 --> 29:32.000
please take care of the household.

29:32.880 --> 29:34.920
If anything comes up at Lizheng Hall,

29:35.000 --> 29:36.640
let Jia'er handle it.

29:36.720 --> 29:38.480
This is also a good opportunity

29:38.560 --> 29:39.680
for her to gain experience.

29:39.760 --> 29:41.160
As for Mother,

29:41.240 --> 29:43.800
don't tell her
that I'm meeting Governor Tong for now.

29:43.880 --> 29:44.760
Remember that.

29:46.440 --> 29:47.280
Commandant Zhu,

29:47.360 --> 29:48.680
when can Mingxuan return?

29:49.240 --> 29:50.920
You would have to ask Governor Tong.

29:51.680 --> 29:54.200
Mr. Ye, let's go if you're done.

30:07.920 --> 30:10.960
Chu Lan will arrive in Luyang
in seven days. Be ready.

30:30.440 --> 30:31.280
Feed me.

30:34.200 --> 30:35.240
You don't want it?

30:38.120 --> 30:39.120
Then I'll throw it away.

30:54.840 --> 30:56.840
When you have time, come to Xihua Brothel.

30:56.920 --> 30:58.080
I'll surely make time for you.

31:05.960 --> 31:08.600
My lord, you should be working,

31:08.680 --> 31:10.040
but why did you flirt around?

31:10.760 --> 31:13.120
It's not easy to clear the debt of love.

31:13.200 --> 31:14.240
Shut up.

31:17.760 --> 31:19.960
My lord, Tong Zhiyang
has already taken action.

31:21.280 --> 31:22.120
That's a bit early.

31:22.200 --> 31:24.720
He sent people straight to the Ye family's
front hall to make an arrest.

31:24.800 --> 31:25.880
There was quite a commotion.

31:25.960 --> 31:27.360
The Ye family can't hide it
even if they want to.

31:27.440 --> 31:29.000
I reckon the entire Luyang knows about it.

31:29.080 --> 31:30.520
It was a show for the Li family.

31:30.600 --> 31:31.880
Naturally, he'd make it big.

31:33.040 --> 31:34.920
I heard Ms. Jiang Li
was also there at the time,

31:35.000 --> 31:36.760
but she didn't do anything.

31:36.840 --> 31:37.680
This time,

31:37.760 --> 31:39.320
can the Li family really succeed?

31:39.400 --> 31:41.280
You never learn your lesson.

31:41.360 --> 31:42.800
Why do you still underestimate her?

31:42.880 --> 31:44.480
I already dare not underestimate her.

31:45.120 --> 31:47.680
But once news of
the problematic Soochow brocades spread,

31:47.760 --> 31:48.840
Lizheng Hall will be in jeopardy.

31:48.920 --> 31:51.680
And now Ye Mingxuan is away.
The Ye family only has a few women left.

31:51.760 --> 31:53.400
The Li family can easily deal with them.

31:53.480 --> 31:56.120
My lord, should we intervene now?

31:56.200 --> 31:58.040
Don't treat them like fools.

31:59.040 --> 32:00.840
The show isn't over yet.

32:00.920 --> 32:02.400
Don't draw conclusions too early.

32:02.480 --> 32:03.600
Keep watching the Ye family.

32:04.320 --> 32:05.160
- Yes.
- Yes.

32:17.360 --> 32:19.200
Tong'er, help me get
another cup of strong tea.

32:21.120 --> 32:22.680
Miss, it's getting late.

32:22.760 --> 32:24.240
Drinking too much strong tea is bad.

32:24.320 --> 32:25.840
You even got up so early this morning.

32:27.920 --> 32:30.320
Jiang Li, you should go back
to your room and rest first.

32:30.400 --> 32:32.320
Don't stay up here with us.

32:32.400 --> 32:34.360
If we don't get news tonight,

32:35.000 --> 32:36.240
I won't be able to sleep either.

32:36.320 --> 32:38.560
I'm afraid that in the end,

32:38.640 --> 32:39.760
we'll get the worst outcome.

32:41.200 --> 32:42.040
Madam Zhuo.

32:43.200 --> 32:44.160
What did they say?

32:47.120 --> 32:49.240
I didn't even get to see Governor Tong.

32:49.320 --> 32:51.840
I thought of using money
to bribe those officials,

32:51.920 --> 32:53.000
but no one dared to take it.

32:53.080 --> 32:54.360
This is absurd!

32:54.440 --> 32:56.160
Even a murderer has a three-session trial.

32:56.240 --> 32:58.760
A Ye family member was arrested
and there's no explanation at all.

32:58.840 --> 32:59.960
I…

33:00.040 --> 33:01.320
Mother, what are you going to do?

33:01.400 --> 33:03.880
- I'll hang myself at the Governor's door.
- Don't make it worse.

33:03.960 --> 33:05.000
I'll see if they still dare

33:05.080 --> 33:07.320
- to be so arrogant!
- Aunt Zhuo, don't be anxious first.

33:07.400 --> 33:09.480
Uncle Mingxuan should still
be safe for now.

33:11.280 --> 33:14.760
They made such a big scene today
by coming to arrest him.

33:15.480 --> 33:17.720
After taking Uncle Mingxuan away,
they didn't hold a trial

33:17.800 --> 33:20.120
and no official documents
were announced to the public.

33:20.720 --> 33:21.960
I'm guessing

33:23.160 --> 33:26.400
Tong Zhiyang and his people are waiting
for the highest offer.

33:26.480 --> 33:27.320
The highest offer?

33:27.960 --> 33:29.880
But didn't they refuse our money?

33:30.480 --> 33:33.000
It's like doing business.
Both sides set prices.

33:33.480 --> 33:36.240
Then there's the bargaining process.

33:36.800 --> 33:39.360
This time, he is the good.

33:39.440 --> 33:41.240
But they refuse to set the price now.

33:41.320 --> 33:44.400
They are waiting for the Ye family
to offer everything you have.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.480
How dare he? He…

33:45.560 --> 33:47.200
Mother, hear Jiang Li out first.

33:48.560 --> 33:50.920
What Aunt Zhuo said is valid.

33:51.000 --> 33:52.920
Although Tong Zhiyang is the governor,

33:53.000 --> 33:55.400
the Ye family
is not insignificant in Luyang.

33:55.480 --> 33:57.160
First, there is no evidence.

33:57.640 --> 33:59.400
Second, there are no official documents.

33:59.480 --> 34:01.480
He arrested the head
of the Ye family just like that.

34:02.040 --> 34:04.360
Isn't Tong Zhiyang afraid
of being reported to His Majesty?

34:04.440 --> 34:06.320
Jiang Li, you mean…

34:06.960 --> 34:10.120
I'm afraid he is just a middleman.

34:11.120 --> 34:13.120
There are people behind him giving orders.

34:13.760 --> 34:16.280
Even Luyang's governor
is working for someone.

34:17.440 --> 34:18.920
What bad luck!

34:19.000 --> 34:21.199
We are honest businessmen.

34:21.280 --> 34:23.719
Which powerful person have we offended?

34:23.800 --> 34:26.120
You haven't offended anyone
in the business.

34:27.040 --> 34:29.120
But that may not be the case
in other areas.

34:29.199 --> 34:30.320
You mean…

34:30.400 --> 34:31.880
To be honest, in the capital,

34:32.480 --> 34:35.000
Shijie once refused
to pledge allegiance to someone.

34:35.080 --> 34:36.000
Pledge allegiance?

34:36.080 --> 34:36.920
Yes.

34:37.400 --> 34:40.239
Chancellor Li Zhongnan
has a son named Li Lian.

34:40.320 --> 34:42.400
He and Shijie are classmates
at the Imperial Academy.

34:42.480 --> 34:43.840
He set Shijie up

34:43.920 --> 34:45.639
to win him over.

34:45.719 --> 34:48.639
After Shijie saw through it,
he had a fallout with Li Lian.

34:48.719 --> 34:50.000
They shouldn't go to this extent.

34:50.080 --> 34:51.520
That is just a small matter. This…

34:51.600 --> 34:53.159
There is no small matter in officialdom.

34:54.320 --> 34:55.760
So do you mean

34:56.280 --> 34:58.920
they want to use
the Ye family to threaten Shijie?

34:59.000 --> 35:01.320
This is just my guess for now.

35:01.400 --> 35:03.480
But before the people behind it

35:03.560 --> 35:05.160
reveal their true intentions,

35:05.240 --> 35:07.240
Uncle Mingxuan will be fine.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.160
Then…

35:08.240 --> 35:09.560
Then isn't Shijie in great danger?

35:09.640 --> 35:12.560
His Majesty had just appointed Shijie
to a position in the capital.

35:13.040 --> 35:17.120
And since the Jiang family is his in-laws,
others won't be able to harm him easily.

35:17.680 --> 35:20.160
But we must not lose our composure.

35:21.520 --> 35:23.840
Perhaps they want us
to make a mistake due to panic.

35:23.920 --> 35:25.040
After hearing what you said,

35:25.120 --> 35:26.600
I feel more relieved.

35:27.120 --> 35:28.160
Then let's wait

35:28.240 --> 35:29.560
for Tong Zhiyang to make a move.

35:29.640 --> 35:33.840
Aunt Zhuo, what happened
to the Soochow brocades?

35:34.520 --> 35:35.640
I've been thinking about it

35:35.720 --> 35:38.120
and I fear this issue has been exploited.

35:45.920 --> 35:49.000
The Soochow brocades are woven
by the Ye family's weaving house.

35:49.760 --> 35:52.160
These are all the samples produced
by the weaving house

35:52.240 --> 35:54.240
in the past three months.

35:54.320 --> 35:56.800
I've checked them thoroughly
and there are no problems.

35:56.880 --> 35:58.760
Out of nowhere, there's a rumor

35:59.320 --> 36:01.320
that the Soochow brocades caused deaths.

36:02.040 --> 36:04.280
The rumors spread like wildfire overnight.

36:04.360 --> 36:06.040
Fabric and clothing shops in Luyang

36:06.120 --> 36:08.240
don't dare to sell them
and want to return them.

36:08.320 --> 36:09.800
Now that I think about it,

36:09.880 --> 36:13.560
this has been a setup
since the rumor started.

36:14.120 --> 36:15.480
Have you investigated

36:16.400 --> 36:19.040
whether the Soochow brocades
really caused deaths?

36:19.120 --> 36:21.520
It's easy to spread rumors
but hard to dispel them.

36:22.400 --> 36:23.520
After the rumors started,

36:23.600 --> 36:25.240
Father sent a lot of people

36:25.320 --> 36:26.480
to investigate it.

36:27.120 --> 36:28.520
We didn't find any deaths,

36:28.600 --> 36:30.960
but we did find a batch

36:31.040 --> 36:32.800
of problematic Soochow brocades.

36:32.880 --> 36:35.000
Anyone who came into contact
with this batch of fabrics

36:35.080 --> 36:37.000
developed red rashes
all over their bodies.

36:37.480 --> 36:41.200
Now, we don't know whether this rumor

36:41.280 --> 36:42.560
is true or false.

36:42.640 --> 36:43.880
Then let's check

36:44.440 --> 36:47.000
this batch of problematic fabrics
together tomorrow morning.

36:53.120 --> 36:53.960
Jiang Li.

36:59.440 --> 37:01.560
If you hadn't stabilized
the situation today,

37:01.640 --> 37:03.240
the Ye family would've fallen into chaos.

37:03.880 --> 37:05.360
Although I am skilled in business,

37:05.440 --> 37:07.600
I don't know the twists and turns
of the officialdom.

37:07.680 --> 37:09.680
Thank you for comforting my mother too.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.640
I am the Ye family's niece.

37:16.000 --> 37:17.480
It's what I should do.

37:20.760 --> 37:22.760
I'm being so polite to you.

37:22.840 --> 37:24.160
It's making me seem pretentious.

37:27.120 --> 37:30.040
But I am still very worried.

37:30.600 --> 37:31.440
About what?

37:32.640 --> 37:34.600
I'm afraid this is just the beginning.

37:34.680 --> 37:36.920
If the people behind this
aren't satisfied this time,

37:37.720 --> 37:40.160
won't the Ye family
ever have peace from now on?

37:40.240 --> 37:42.160
Why would we let them succeed this time?

37:42.240 --> 37:43.680
Didn't you say that the officialdom…

37:44.720 --> 37:47.080
Did they study hard for years
to become officials

37:47.160 --> 37:48.880
and rise up the ranks

37:48.960 --> 37:51.080
just to oppress civilians
with their power?

37:51.160 --> 37:53.840
They won't stop
because of your concessions.

37:54.440 --> 37:56.720
They will only push further without mercy.

37:57.360 --> 37:59.680
The Ye family's ancestors braved hardships

37:59.760 --> 38:01.200
to achieve wealth in Luyang today.

38:02.240 --> 38:05.080
If even you guys give in this time,

38:05.160 --> 38:06.640
in the future, not only the Ye family

38:06.720 --> 38:08.800
but many others will also suffer.

38:10.200 --> 38:11.320
You're right.

38:11.400 --> 38:13.520
Back then, I almost died in Zhennv Hall.

38:14.360 --> 38:15.520
But I endured it.

38:16.280 --> 38:18.040
Since I could come back alive,

38:18.600 --> 38:20.800
the Ye family will definitely be fine.

38:28.200 --> 38:29.040
Jiang Li.

38:34.880 --> 38:36.240
BINGDE HALL

38:36.760 --> 38:37.960
Why haven't I seen Aunt Zhuo?

38:38.760 --> 38:40.480
My mother went
to take care of Grandmother.

38:40.560 --> 38:43.160
Now, everyone in the family
is hiding it from Grandmother.

38:43.240 --> 38:44.880
I wonder how long we can keep it from her.

38:45.360 --> 38:46.200
Don't worry.

38:46.680 --> 38:49.040
We'll get to the bottom
of the Soochow brocades issue today.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.800
Ms. Jia'er, something bad happened!

38:51.880 --> 38:54.240
Lizheng Hall was trashed.

38:55.080 --> 38:55.920
Trashed?

38:56.000 --> 38:58.240
Those people came in
and started trashing the place.

38:58.320 --> 39:00.880
Even the signboard
of Lizheng Hall was destroyed.

39:00.960 --> 39:02.920
They even hit my nose
and it became crooked.

39:03.000 --> 39:04.760
How will I find a wife in the future?

39:05.520 --> 39:07.520
Ms. Jia'er, please go and take a look.

39:08.200 --> 39:09.400
How many people came?

39:09.480 --> 39:10.960
At least dozens of people.

39:11.040 --> 39:14.120
They've surrounded
the entire Lizheng Hall.

39:14.200 --> 39:15.120
They said

39:15.600 --> 39:17.760
that the Soochow brocades
we previously sold

39:17.840 --> 39:18.880
are still causing harm.

39:20.040 --> 39:21.960
Jiang Li, wait at home. I'll go and check.

39:23.360 --> 39:25.760
Let's go together and think of a solution.

39:33.720 --> 39:34.960
My lord is indeed amazing.

39:35.040 --> 39:35.960
Li Jin is inside.

39:36.880 --> 39:39.680
He still likes to sit in the tea house
and watch his own bad shows.

39:39.760 --> 39:40.680
Then we…

39:42.480 --> 39:43.760
Are you Duke Su?

39:44.840 --> 39:45.920
Mr. Li, in the private room,

39:46.000 --> 39:47.400
would like to invite you.

39:48.160 --> 39:51.440
He said if you are coming to see him,
you should do so openly.

39:51.520 --> 39:54.680
Why do you need to send someone
to spy sneakily?

39:54.760 --> 39:56.480
- Who are you calling sneaky?
- Lead the way.

39:56.960 --> 39:57.800
This way.

40:07.000 --> 40:07.880
Mr. Li.

40:08.520 --> 40:10.680
I didn't expect to meet you in Luyang.

40:10.760 --> 40:12.040
What a coincidence.

40:16.960 --> 40:20.520
I did expect to meet you in Luyang.

40:21.080 --> 40:23.320
Good tea and a good show.

40:24.960 --> 40:26.320
Thank you, Mr. Li.

40:30.800 --> 40:32.000
So you invited me here

40:32.080 --> 40:33.840
to watch people trash Lizheng Hall.

40:33.920 --> 40:37.800
You're overthinking.
We're just having tea.

40:39.920 --> 40:42.480
- Stop!
- We've never encountered it before either!

40:43.000 --> 40:45.080
- Stop it!
- Can you please stop?

40:48.000 --> 40:50.240
I know her! She is Ms. Ye!

40:50.320 --> 40:51.240
Sir.

40:51.760 --> 40:53.920
- Ms. Jia'er, you're here.
- It has been tough on you.

40:54.000 --> 40:56.640
- Go inside and tend to your injuries.
- But there are so many people.

40:56.720 --> 40:58.600
It's all right. I've got this. Fu.

41:00.000 --> 41:01.280
Let's go, sir.

41:01.360 --> 41:02.760
Someone in charge has come.

41:02.840 --> 41:04.160
- Don't leave!
- Don't go!

41:05.680 --> 41:07.800
I am Ye Jia'er,
the person in charge of Lizheng Hall.

41:07.880 --> 41:09.000
If you have anything to say,

41:09.080 --> 41:10.440
we can sit down and talk about it.

41:10.520 --> 41:12.200
The Ye family
will give you an explanation.

41:12.280 --> 41:15.720
- Screw you! What's the use?
- Right!

41:15.800 --> 41:19.160
The Ye family's fabrics
have turned into shrouds!

41:19.240 --> 41:20.880
That's right! You've caused deaths.

41:20.960 --> 41:22.560
And you dare to earn money from us.

41:22.640 --> 41:25.160
You earn money in a dishonest way
at the cost of people's lives!

41:25.240 --> 41:26.440
- Yes!
- Right!

41:26.520 --> 41:27.440
- You're dishonest!
- Yes!

41:29.280 --> 41:30.120
Everyone!

41:31.760 --> 41:32.640
Everyone!

41:33.560 --> 41:35.840
I don't know how the idea
that Soochow brocades cause deaths

41:35.920 --> 41:36.760
came about.

41:36.840 --> 41:37.960
But the Ye family

41:38.040 --> 41:40.120
has been doing business in Luyang
for many years.

41:40.200 --> 41:42.160
Our reputation is well-known.

41:42.240 --> 41:44.400
We can't bear such a grave accusation

41:44.480 --> 41:45.640
of causing deaths for profits.

41:47.120 --> 41:50.280
Please give us some time to investigate.

41:50.360 --> 41:52.080
Liar! The Ye family are liars!

41:52.160 --> 41:53.520
Pay with your lives!

41:53.600 --> 41:57.960
- Murderers should pay with their lives!
- Murderers should pay with their lives!

41:58.040 --> 42:02.560
- Murderers should pay with their lives!
- Murderers should pay with their lives!

42:02.640 --> 42:04.000
Great! Help is coming.

42:04.880 --> 42:07.160
- Not necessarily.
- Commandant is here.

42:07.240 --> 42:09.360
- Take her away.
- Why are you arresting me?

42:09.960 --> 42:12.240
Why are you arresting me
and not the troublemakers?

42:12.320 --> 42:13.760
We received a report

42:13.840 --> 42:16.600
that Lizheng Hall sold inferior fabrics

42:16.680 --> 42:17.760
and caused deaths.

42:18.440 --> 42:19.560
Aren't you the one in charge?

42:19.640 --> 42:20.560
Come with us.

42:20.640 --> 42:22.000
- Yes, arrest her!
- Great!

42:22.560 --> 42:25.160
Lizheng Hall's fabrics caused deaths!

42:25.240 --> 42:26.480
Shouldn't she be arrested?

42:26.560 --> 42:27.400
Arrest her!

42:27.480 --> 42:31.320
- Arrest her!
- Arrest her!

42:31.400 --> 42:35.400
- Arrest her!
- Arrest her!

42:43.840 --> 42:44.680
May I ask

42:45.440 --> 42:47.280
who told you
the Ye family's Soochow brocades

42:47.760 --> 42:48.960
have problems?

42:50.000 --> 42:51.320
Look at what you're saying.

42:51.400 --> 42:53.840
Who doesn't know about the problems

42:53.920 --> 42:55.360
with Lizheng Hall's Soochow brocades?

42:56.800 --> 42:57.640
Look at me.

42:57.720 --> 43:00.080
Come, take a look. Come and see!

43:00.160 --> 43:01.720
- I've got rashes all over my body.
- Yes.

43:01.800 --> 43:03.200
- Look, everyone!
- Right.

43:05.760 --> 43:06.640
Jiang Li, you…

43:10.600 --> 43:11.440
What are you doing?

43:12.880 --> 43:13.720
Hold it.

43:18.760 --> 43:19.600
Tong'er.

43:22.200 --> 43:23.080
Everyone, take a look.

43:24.240 --> 43:25.360
The clothes I'm wearing

43:25.440 --> 43:26.960
are from Lizheng Hall.

43:27.040 --> 43:29.320
They were given to me by Ms. Ye yesterday.

43:30.760 --> 43:32.720
They were also made from Soochow brocades.

43:32.800 --> 43:34.000
I've been wearing them all day,

43:34.080 --> 43:35.960
but I don't have any rashes like you.

43:37.240 --> 43:38.080
You don't believe me?

43:38.600 --> 43:39.520
Fine.

43:39.600 --> 43:40.720
If you don't believe me,

43:41.200 --> 43:43.600
these ladies can pass it around
and see for yourselves.

43:44.560 --> 43:45.720
- Here, take a look.
- Come on.

43:47.200 --> 43:48.320
Is it?

43:48.400 --> 43:51.160
This is indeed Soochow brocade
from the shop.

43:51.240 --> 43:53.000
If the Soochow brocades
really had a problem,

43:53.080 --> 43:55.720
wouldn't I be seeking my own death
by wearing them?

43:55.800 --> 43:57.400
What's impossible about that?

43:57.480 --> 43:58.680
You're the Ye family's shill.

43:58.760 --> 44:00.640
You took the Ye family's money
to put on an act.

44:00.720 --> 44:02.120
Your life is worth nothing!

44:02.200 --> 44:03.720
You got it wrong.

44:03.800 --> 44:07.280
My life is worth more
than the entire Lizheng Hall.

44:09.480 --> 44:12.040
You're boasting so shamelessly.
Who are you?

44:12.840 --> 44:15.240
I'm the daughter
of Great Yan's Chief Secretariat

44:15.320 --> 44:17.440
and His Majesty's Grand Preceptor,

44:17.520 --> 44:18.800
Jiang Li.

44:20.040 --> 44:21.040
- Jiang Li?
- Jiang Li?

44:25.160 --> 44:27.680
I didn't expect that Jiang Li

44:27.760 --> 44:29.400
would reveal her identity

44:29.480 --> 44:31.200
to stand up for the Ye family.

44:32.920 --> 44:36.040
Isn't she afraid of being accused
of covering up for the Ye family?

44:37.120 --> 44:38.000
Mr. Li,

44:38.880 --> 44:40.480
the best part of the show is yet to come.
